#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

ROOT="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/.." && pwd)"
OUT_DIR="$ROOT/statistical-analyses"
mkdir -p "$OUT_DIR"

ANALYSIS="${*:-analysis}"
SLUG="$(printf '%s' "$ANALYSIS" | tr '[:upper:]' '[:lower:]' | tr -cs 'a-z0-9' '-' | sed 's/^-//; s/-$//; s/--*/-/g')"
if [ -z "$SLUG" ]; then
  SLUG="analysis"
fi

STAMP="$(date '+%Y%m%d-%H%M%S')"
OUT="$OUT_DIR/$STAMP-$SLUG-statistical-analysis.md"

cat > "$OUT" <<MD
# Statistical Analysis Plan: $ANALYSIS

Generated: $(date '+%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z')

## Research Question

- Question:
- Decision this informs:
- Dataset:
- Unit of observation:

## Variables

| Variable | Role | Type | Coding | Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
|  | IV / DV / control | nominal / ordinal / interval / ratio |  |  |

## Data Audit

- N:
- Missing data:
- Outliers:
- Duplicate rows:
- Coding issues:
- Sample size adequacy:

## Test Plan

| Hypothesis | Test | Why This Test | Assumptions To Check |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| H0:  |  |  |  |

## Assumption Matrix

| Test | Assumption | Check Method | Pass? | Note |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
|  |  |  |  |  |

## Results Template

| Test | Statistic | df | p-value | Effect Size | CI | Decision |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |

## Interpretation

- Statistical statement:
- Effect size meaning:
- Practical meaning:
- Limitations:

## Report Shape

- Introduction:
- Methodology:
- Results:
- Discussion:
- Limitations:
- Appendix:

## Next Slice

- Calculation needed:
- Verification:
MD

printf '%s\n' "$OUT"
